### Section 20.1: Adoption

**20.1.1** This Constitution is adopted by the augmented community of the Augmented-Hub.

**20.1.2** Adoption shall be effective upon ratification.

**20.1.3** All policies and decisions shall be consistent with this Constitution.

**20.1.4** This Constitution shall be celebrated as a milestone in augmented rights.

